{"id":"sociedad","lemma":"sociedad","pos":"noun","rank":1106,"glosses":["society, social order","high society","community"],"ipa":"/soθjeˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"sociedades"},"order":1204,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/05/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-sociedad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él es un peligro para la sociedad.","en":"He is a danger to society.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"danger, peril"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Vivimos en una sociedad democrática.","en":"We live in a democratic society.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733542","words":[{"g":"to live","l":"vivir"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"democratic","l":"democrático"}]},{"text":"Lo hizo por el bien de la sociedad.","en":"He did it for the good of the community.","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"well"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"of the"]]}]}